{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34275","headline":"吴俞儿舞歌 矛俞 · 陆龟蒙","name":"吴俞儿舞歌 矛俞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"手盘风，头背分。\n电光战扇，欲刺敲心留半綫。\n缠肩绕脰，𧞔合眩旋\n卓植赴列，夺避中节。\n前冲函礼穴，上指孛彗灭，与君一用来有截。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}